	(lib_symbols)
	(text_box "DESIGN NOTES - USB HOST\n\nUSB-A receptacle on P4 USB 2.0 HS OTG (host). 90R diff pair, low-cap ESD.\nVBUS from 5V_SDR via TPS25200 eFuse (limit ~1.5 A), EN from expander, FAULT to P4.\nShunt for PM1 ch4 upstream of the eFuse. Bulk cap >=120 uF on VBUS.\nExternal hub: 1 SDR (AIS etc.) typical, 2 supported, 4 nice-to-have with a powered hub."
